Brawler credits

Everything in this game is generated by this repository's own code:
  models   tools/make-characters.mjs, tools/charmesh.mjs, tools/gltf-writer.mjs (twelve skinned characters with modelled
           clothing, hair cards and accessories, one bone layout with spring bones, and their clips; faces with expression
           morph targets, tools/face.mjs); src/secondary.c (spring motion and the faces driven by name at run time); tools/blender/lineup.py renders a check sheet (CPU)
  scenery  tools/make-world.mjs, tools/mesher.mjs (streets, buildings, lamp posts, props and the docks jukebox as textured glb)
  textures tools/make-textures.mjs, tools/texlib.mjs (every albedo, normal, roughness, occlusion, emissive map, the faces
           and the decals are procedural: noise, cells, bricks, planks, plates, windows drawn by code)
  grading  tools/make-luts.mjs (the colour lookup table of each stage)
  levels   src/level.c (lighting, fog and grade per stage; the scenery glb is loaded per stage)
  sound    src/fx.c (every sound effect, the street beats and Arthur's jukebox song are computed)
  fonts    the engine's built-in UI font (see the engine's NOTICE)

Third-party code or assets: none.

